      "message": "The purpose of this change is not to fix all issues related to versioned snapshots or even provide the right way to create a versioned snapshot. It is intended to:\n1. Allow the generated Android.bp file to more closely match the Android.bp file generated by the template in generate_ml_bundle.sh to allow the sdk snapshot generation to replace that templating mechanism.\n2. To provide a quick and simple way to create a numbered version of a snapshot to allow experimentation with versioned snapshots and identify the remaining issues and fix them.\n",
